# Tapping a different land leaves Kudzu's land untouched; when that land taps with no other land available, Kudzu falls off (CR 603.2, 704.5m).
[Bot1 Deck]
Kudzu
Black Lotus
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Kudzu.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
? Bot1.Mana =
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kudzu.AttachedTo = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Choose(Bot2.Battlefield.Island)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Kudzu; Forest; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Island
